    "turn_idx": 11,
    "turn_text": "Merry Christmas right back at you. Let me start here with the big story yesterday that Joe Biden said, read different polls. 34% approval rating, Ron. 34%. He's made things bad for business, made things bad for my bank account. I make a pretty good buck. I do okay. But I am nowhere near in the kind of shape I was when Trump was leaving office. What specifically happened to our economy? And what is Biden keep trying to take credit for it being good?",
