        "text": "The speaker considers financial success during Trump’s presidency as a benchmark for national economic health.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker assumes that Biden bears responsibility for negative economic conditions post-Trump.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes economic performance should be judged by personal financial outcomes.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker trusts their own experience as valid evidence of broader economic trends.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker views Biden’s attempts to claim credit for economic improvement as disingenuous.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      }
    ],
    "turn_type_label": "Substantive",
    "conversation_move_label": "Assert / Elaborate"
  },
  {
