    "turn_idx": 28,
    "turn_text": "U.S. Senator from the great state of Wisconsin, it's Ron Johnson, and we appreciate the time, Ron. When will we get a balanced budget? I know it sounds like a dumb question. I already don't like baseline budgeting where every year goes up automatically. I'm not really sure why you guys have to do that. But is it going to take the Senate going back into Republican hands? Do we have to get the president again? We haven't had a balanced budget since Bill Clinton. And that was because the very Republican House and Senate forced his hand. When will we start balancing that you and I have to balance our budgets and our homes? Why don't you guys have to do it in Washington?",
